{
    "word": "наповал",
    "lang_code": "ru",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d0f48096-67ec-3353-9de6-6b2dc119322b",
                "word": "наповал",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4700d1b6-da74-322f-be1d-92e6ff642250",
                        "entry_id": "d0f48096-67ec-3353-9de6-6b2dc119322b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сразив одним ударом, с одного выстрела; сразу насмерть"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd159a45-c6ef-4d41-ab15-e4724defd87c",
                                "sense_id": "4700d1b6-da74-322f-be1d-92e6ff642250",
                                "text": "На рассвете первый выстрел убил наповал унтер-офицера Тенгинского полка, находившегося в цепи, пуля хватила его прямо в лоб."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36349509-9c23-4e9d-93a4-56d95d837a2a",
                                "sense_id": "4700d1b6-da74-322f-be1d-92e6ff642250",
                                "text": "Он был убит, убит наповал, и в самое сердце."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "573b7ea3-5e51-4dcb-88ec-ed63345beab3",
                                "sense_id": "4700d1b6-da74-322f-be1d-92e6ff642250",
                                "text": "Видимо, мерин был убит наповал ― возле уха чернела рваная рана, от которой к губам тянулась струйка застывшей крови."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbb55f91-2c34-3754-ae97-730662968cb8",
                        "entry_id": "d0f48096-67ec-3353-9de6-6b2dc119322b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. очень сильно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8623acc8-67ba-4fc4-bb0f-1c53869ce74d",
                                "sense_id": "bbb55f91-2c34-3754-ae97-730662968cb8",
                                "text": "Он постоял на пороге, морщась от их разноголосого храпа и от запахов ― нефти, глины, сыромятной кожи и пота, ― бивших в нос наповал."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b06fc4ce-865d-474e-8ec9-0b2b6c97b1a1",
                                "sense_id": "bbb55f91-2c34-3754-ae97-730662968cb8",
                                "text": "Который свет ругает наповал"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94a22b84-a561-4f36-b511-c83b27cfe674",
                        "source_entry_id": "d0f48096-67ec-3353-9de6-6b2dc119322b",
                        "target_lang_word": "outright",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "outright",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8deb913-96fa-3781-acc2-1ed69226f3e8",
                                        "entry_id": "825a1f0c-2756-37f5-905e-dd2b078906eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wholly; completely; entirely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b217c9f7-1be7-4fb0-b3a8-2f5f2961d8c0",
                                                "sense_id": "c8deb913-96fa-3781-acc2-1ed69226f3e8",
                                                "text": "I refute those allegations outright."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a268399d-8fc5-400d-8bb1-91bd7113b0c1",
                                                "sense_id": "c8deb913-96fa-3781-acc2-1ed69226f3e8",
                                                "text": "Special facilities frequently are provided to enable visiting photographers to get the best results, whereas in the past cameras were sometimes banned outright."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87d493d8-8232-3023-b70d-9e1a3dd24339",
                                        "entry_id": "825a1f0c-2756-37f5-905e-dd2b078906eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Openly and without reservation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315cbdf2-b544-4134-8add-03bb459af53b",
                                                "sense_id": "87d493d8-8232-3023-b70d-9e1a3dd24339",
                                                "text": "I have just responded outright to that question."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f83f6164-dbb9-30e6-b10c-c1ccf3aecc1d",
                                        "entry_id": "825a1f0c-2756-37f5-905e-dd2b078906eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At once."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a28c6625-01f9-4b31-82fe-95096c583711",
                                                "sense_id": "f83f6164-dbb9-30e6-b10c-c1ccf3aecc1d",
                                                "text": "Two people died outright and one more later."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57e276fa-1e56-3efa-ba26-064cfe6c6d3b",
                                        "entry_id": "825a1f0c-2756-37f5-905e-dd2b078906eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With no outstanding conditions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26449e6-b02f-47e8-a77f-36b7fd70a036",
                                                "sense_id": "57e276fa-1e56-3efa-ba26-064cfe6c6d3b",
                                                "text": "I have bought the house outright."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b901e49-6a3e-3542-b128-a26cd741e71f",
                                        "entry_id": "825a1f0c-2756-37f5-905e-dd2b078906eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Blatantly; inexcusably; unambiguously."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d53bab3e-f057-4f55-958d-8eaa7370fb8b",
                                                "sense_id": "4b901e49-6a3e-3542-b128-a26cd741e71f",
                                                "text": "That was an outright stupid thing to say."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "outright",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b09e63a6-c8bf-36d9-a782-88201e346a4c",
                                        "entry_id": "47818bc9-2634-36bf-b71e-523f761683dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unqualified and unreserved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f5577c4-fff6-427f-b6ab-3028757d65b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b09e63a6-c8bf-36d9-a782-88201e346a4c",
                                                "text": "I demand an outright apology."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "182d1a54-46a4-3937-a90c-78e4ed72766e",
                                        "entry_id": "47818bc9-2634-36bf-b71e-523f761683dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Total or complete."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56b57422-009b-4203-ac47-45419d9169a4",
                                                "sense_id": "182d1a54-46a4-3937-a90c-78e4ed72766e",
                                                "text": "We achieved outright domination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31426ce6-34fd-445c-876d-79cede649788",
                                                "sense_id": "182d1a54-46a4-3937-a90c-78e4ed72766e",
                                                "text": "Truths, half truths and outright lies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d20de880-e623-4025-bcba-1eeabb11df4d",
                                                "sense_id": "182d1a54-46a4-3937-a90c-78e4ed72766e",
                                                "text": "With little effort they found dozens of outright lies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64fa9854-aa28-4e57-b323-a4cf848cb202",
                                                "sense_id": "182d1a54-46a4-3937-a90c-78e4ed72766e",
                                                "text": "He found a pattern of non-transparency and outright deception."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1f91d42-1645-3817-951f-069b06033f68",
                                        "entry_id": "47818bc9-2634-36bf-b71e-523f761683dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no outstanding conditions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36641f23-e049-4109-90d9-9a44d4d56b28",
                                                "sense_id": "b1f91d42-1645-3817-951f-069b06033f68",
                                                "text": "I made an outright purchase of the house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3fc6fb4-1850-41d7-90d6-475de3b2dcfe",
                                                "sense_id": "b1f91d42-1645-3817-951f-069b06033f68",
                                                "text": "They don't seek outright independence, but rather greater autonomy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "outright",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d82f90b6-14ac-3f3c-baf5-f2a1189e0654",
                                        "entry_id": "8d12df2f-2029-3b5e-969f-6b1180fb7f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To release a player outright, without conditions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88d61302-fc7e-435f-baac-d466a331401c",
                                                "sense_id": "d82f90b6-14ac-3f3c-baf5-f2a1189e0654",
                                                "text": "Sandy Alomar Jr. cleared waivers and was outrighted to Class AA Binghamton in preparation for his promotion when rosters expand Saturday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f160410d-1443-4716-9768-ae20fd8a0fb7",
                        "source_entry_id": "d0f48096-67ec-3353-9de6-6b2dc119322b",
                        "target_lang_word": "on the spot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "on the spot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a49a0957-7a88-36a1-88d4-67887e926468",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed984a-efcd-3af8-be15-20ee541d13c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At that very moment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b195ac15-6278-4742-863a-b83caefab4bd",
                                                "sense_id": "a49a0957-7a88-36a1-88d4-67887e926468",
                                                "text": "He liked the house, so he made an offer on the spot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d661298-be63-4857-b65d-44a3ee42ce3b",
                                                "sense_id": "a49a0957-7a88-36a1-88d4-67887e926468",
                                                "text": "There are in the Armies a great many Inſtances of Gun-ſhot Wounds of the Arm near the Scapula, which require Amputation at the Shoulder; but the Apprehenſion of loſing their Patients on the Spot by the Hæmorrhage, has deterred Surgeons from undertaking it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1690567-3a25-3d6e-a90c-f9f2b7b86f21",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed984a-efcd-3af8-be15-20ee541d13c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having to answer or decide without warning or preparation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d4ed05e-8a06-489d-97a2-4a708932c391",
                                                "sense_id": "c1690567-3a25-3d6e-a90c-f9f2b7b86f21",
                                                "text": "All the sudden questions put him on the spot and he had to think quickly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c22fef38-bc49-389d-85ff-6eacd4f15b09",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed984a-efcd-3af8-be15-20ee541d13c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a particular place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f92adf2-6387-4e1e-951e-8e9167832ac7",
                                                "sense_id": "c22fef38-bc49-389d-85ff-6eacd4f15b09",
                                                "text": "This report comes from our man on the spot in Gaza."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9dbca98-8423-4e77-ae97-6e37bc146b0b",
                                                "sense_id": "c22fef38-bc49-389d-85ff-6eacd4f15b09",
                                                "text": "We exercised by jumping up and down on the spot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f43a71d4-eb05-44c1-a63c-d3b180ff37b1",
                                                "sense_id": "c22fef38-bc49-389d-85ff-6eacd4f15b09",
                                                "text": "I had accepted an engagement to go out with Mystofilms Ltd. in Fake of Dead Man's Bush—the dwarf-men picture, you know, taken on the spot among the Australian bushmen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26ddbcdd-449f-4da3-b52b-56d50a925d7a",
                                                "sense_id": "c22fef38-bc49-389d-85ff-6eacd4f15b09",
                                                "text": "[…] on October 29, 1888, the Russian imperial train was derailed at Borki by defective track, and twenty-one persons were killed. Although these did not include the Emperor Alexander III, who escaped with a bruising, a footman serving coffee to him at the critical moment, and his dog, which was lying on the floor beside him, were both killed on the spot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
